    {
      "v": 15,
      "zh": "所以，他们在　神宝座前，昼夜在他殿中事奉他。坐宝座的要用帐幕覆庇他们。",
      "en": "For this reason they are before the throne of God, and they serve[NOTE:1] him day and night in his temple, and the one seated on the throne will shelter them.[NOTE:2]",
      "notes": [
